min":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nHi, I logged #9163 which was marked as Fixed, but it looks like in 1.5.0.Final the problem is not fixed and worse off than before.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nCommand Mode should exit completely after a failure (unhandled exception) occurs. There shouldn't be a message to restart as that is not proper CLI behavior and it shouldn't sit waiting for a response.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nCommand Mode still hangs and lets you press Enter or Ctrl+C to restart, which isn't right as a CLI app should fully exit in a failure scenario. Also Ctrl + C does not restart and appears to do nothing on MacOS.\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Create an empty quarkus command mode project with the following code:\r\nJavaMain:\r\n```\r\n@QuarkusMain\r\npublic class JavaMain\r\n{\r\n  public static void main(String... args) {\r\n    Quarkus.run(Testing.class, args);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTesting.java:\r\n```\r\npublic class Testing implements QuarkusApplication\r\n{\r\n  @Override\r\n  public int run(final String... args) {\r\n    boolean willFail = args[0].equals(\"foo\");\r\n\r\n    return 0;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n2. Run either in Intellij or command line. Behavior was observed to be the same in Intellij and dockerized native image.\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\nNo additional configuration is needed.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n- Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n**Darwin MacBook-Pro.local 19.4.0 Darwin Kernel Version 19.4.0: Wed Mar  4 22:28:40 PST 2020; root:xnu-6153.101.6~15/RELEASE_X86_64 x86_64**\r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\n**openjdk version \"11.0.3\" 2019-04-16\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.3+7)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM AdoptOpenJDK (build 11.0.3+7, mixed mode)**\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n**n/a**\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: \r\n**1.4.1.Final**\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`): \r\n**Tested with mvnw and mvn, both 3.6.3**\r\n\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n(Add any other context about the problem here.)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/9808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/9808/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]